   "en": "Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Was that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "...Violet?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Is this more of what happened to me...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Violet and Dr. Maruki are both in it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Just as I thought...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "Let's move on.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Makoto",
   "en": "It seems we don't actually have to[n]witness these to progress onward.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Just a second, please...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Akechi",
   "en": "I agree with Queen here.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Akechi",
   "en": "It'd be more efficient to keep moving.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "But watching it will cut back the time[n]I would need to explain myself—that[n]would actually be more efficient.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Sorry to insist, Crow-senpai, everyone—[n]but please, watch this with me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Yusuke",
   "en": "Are you certain...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Well, I did decide to join you all in this,[n]so... I should be as honest as possible[n]with everyone.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "We are teammates, you know.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "We're teammates now, huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "...Ya got us there.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "...Looks like it's starting.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
